4. Model weights and checkpoints
--------------------------------

Model weights are not source code, are not covered by this repository's
GPL-3.0-only grant, and are not stored in this repository.

  * SegFormer backbone. The segmentation model uses the pretrained
    `nvidia/mit-b0` SegFormer encoder obtained from Hugging Face. Those weights
    are NVIDIA's work and are distributed under NVIDIA's own terms; consult the
    `nvidia/mit-b0` model card before any redistribution or commercial use.
    This project did not train the backbone and claims no ownership of it.

  * Raster-to-Graph checkpoint. The pretrained wall-graph checkpoint used by
    Phase 4 is published by the upstream Raster-to-Graph authors and must be
    obtained from them. It is not redistributed here and is not included in any
    release artifact produced by this repository.

  * Decoder weights trained in this project. Only the custom `FloorplanDecoder`
    head was trained here. Any release bundle produced from this repository
    contains that trained head together with the configuration needed to load
    it, and remains subject to the upstream terms above for the frozen backbone
    it depends on.


5. Dataset
----------

Training, validation, and test data come from the CubiCasa5K dataset
(`high_quality_architectural` subset). CubiCasa5K is obtained separately from
its own official source under its own terms. It is **not** redistributed in this
repository and is **not** included in any release artifact produced from it.

  Kalervo, A., Ylioinas, J., Häikiö, M., Karhu, A., and Kannala, J.
  "CubiCasa5K: A Dataset and an Improved Multi-Task Model for Floorplan Image
  Analysis." Scandinavian Conference on Image Analysis (SCIA), 2019.
  https://github.com/CubiCasa/CubiCasa5k

CubiCasa5K is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0
International (CC BY-NC 4.0). That license permits sharing and adaptation with
attribution, but prohibits commercial use.

  * `docs/images/` — the curated README images are renderings of, and pipeline
